OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely dry and bright day,
OL,6,Fwith the best of the sunshine across
OL,7,Fthe south. Northern areas will see
OL,8,Fmore in the way of cloud at times,
OL,9,Fwith perhaps the odd spot of rain
OL,10,Fpossible in the far north later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FStaying fine and dry across
OL,13,Fthe south this evening, but rather
OL,14,Fcloudy in the north with the odd spot
OL,15,Fof rain. Cloud spreading further south
OL,16,Fovernight, with clearer skies
OL,17,Ffollowing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
