OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA grey start in the south but
OL,6,Fthis will gradually clear, leaving a
OL,7,Ffine and sunny day across the region.
OL,8,FFeeling a little cooler but still warm.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,11,Fover the next few days with plenty of
OL,12,Fsunshine. Turning hotter through the
OL,13,Fweek, and increasingly humid from mid-
OL,14,Fweek with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
